d":22043,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":220430101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":4254245218,"text":"Huh, how did I run out of wood...","nextNodeIds":[220430102]},{"nodeId":220430102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":3069842354,"text":"Oh, hey there, Traveler! You're just the person I was hoping to see. Do you mind doing me a favor?","nextNodeIds":[220430103,220430104]},{"nodeId":220430103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":88761274,"text":"What's that?","nextNodeIds":[220430105]},{"nodeId":220430105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":3431683810,"text":"I've been trying to make smaller-scale wood carvings of our provisional head priestess.","nextNodeIds":[220430106]},{"nodeId":220430106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":1047984922,"text":"I've been thinking to bring a batch of these to Narukami Island to see if they'll sell...","nextNodeIds":[220430107]},{"nodeId":220430107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":3681595282,"text":"If they do, they would make for a source of consistent income for me.","nextNodeIds":[220430108,220430111]},{"nodeId":220430108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1111382506,"text":"Oh, I think they'll sell alright.","nextNodeIds":[220430109]},{"nodeId":220430109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":3328548026,"text":"Hahaha. Thanks for your well-wishes.","nextNodeIds":[220430110]},{"nodeId":220430110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":1146153714,"text":"That said, I think I've got faith in our Lady Neko's charisma.","nextNodeIds":[220430118]},{"nodeId":220430118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":2420072114,"text":"Well, never mind that for now. Let's talk about the matter at hand...","nextNodeIds":[220430119]},{"nodeId":220430119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":2980645626,"text":"So, the issue is that I'm running out of the wood I was using to practice.","nextNodeIds":[220430120]},{"nodeId":220430120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":3293977858,"text":"Could you help me collect 10 blocks of Otogi Wood, Traveler?","nextNodeIds":[220430121,220430123]},{"nodeId":220430121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1708559818,"text":"Sure.","nextNodeIds":[220430122]},{"nodeId":220430122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":916321610,"text":"I'll leave it to you, then. You're a really great help.","nextNodeIds":[220430126]},{"nodeId":220430126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":319191746,"text":"Bring those Otogi Wood blocks to me once you're done.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220430123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1084434962,"text":"Do you really need that many?","nextNodeIds":[220430124]},{"nodeId":220430124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":1380597618,"text":"Well, I've only just started practicing, so it's best to be on the safe side and prepare more material.","nextNodeIds":[220430125]},{"nodeId":220430125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":494650778,"text":"Well, I'm counting on you, Traveler.","nextNodeIds":[220430126]},{"nodeId":220430111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3662831850,"text":"What's with the wood carvings all of a sudden?","nextNodeIds":[220430112]},{"nodeId":220430112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":4088346370,"text":"Oh, well... Do you know what my payment from our head priestess has been so far?","nextNodeIds":[220430113]},{"nodeId":220430113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":539079498,"text":"They're generally these... bottles, cups, plates, and things like that.","nextNodeIds":[220430114]},{"nodeId":220430114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":636896226,"text":"They do look a bit old, but when I went to have them appraised, we found out that these things are in fact a bit \"ancient\"... and valuable, too.","nextNodeIds":[220430115]},{"nodeId":220430115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":4115428970,"text":"But to tell the truth, it was pretty troublesome and tiring getting them sold every time.","nextNodeIds":[220430116]},{"nodeId":220430116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":535893978,"text":"Also, this really doesn't make for a particularly stable income... If the head priestess were to run out of these things one day, wouldn't that basically put me out of a job?","nextNodeIds":[220430117]},{"nodeId":220430117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3182,"speakerName":"Ooshima Junpei","textMapHash":1732757194,"text":"As such, I've decided to pursue a new business venture.","nextNodeIds":[220430118]},{"nodeId":220430104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":867158450,"text":"What are you doing?","nextNodeIds":[220430105]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2204301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"Q